---
doc: {title: "mylib: перевірка", language: uk-UA}
---
|% Test document: expect() calls fail() at the first difference, so
|% "primula check" exits with code 2 and names the expectation.
|import("../mylib")
|code:
def expect(name, got, wanted):
    if got != wanted:
        fail(f"{name}: отримано {repr(got)}, очікувалося {repr(wanted)}")


expect("rate_on", mylib.rate_on(date(2026, 10, 26)), 20)
expect("amount", mylib.amount(dec("100.00"), date(2026, 10, 26)), dec("120.00"))
|end
mylib |(mylib.VERSION): |(money(mylib.amount(dec("100.00"), date(2026, 10, 26)), "UAH")).
